# Locally downloaded dev tooling (k6). Not committed; see docs/load-testing.md.
.tooling/

# Load-test fixture and raw results. Regenerated by `npm run loadtest`.
loadtest/fixture.json
loadtest/results/

# Raw capture from scripts/record-walkthrough.mjs. The encoded files the site
# actually serves (site/media/tutorial.*) are committed; the multi-megabyte
# source take is not.
site/media/raw/

# macOS makes "file 2.ext" copies when a sync agent sees a conflict. They are
# always stale, and in site/ they would be deployed as live pages.
* [0-9].html
* [0-9].css
* [0-9].js
